  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "This property is superbly positioned for the sun, privacy and offers the perfect balance of comfort, style, and coastal living in highly sought-after Castor Bay.\r\n\r\nOriginally built circa the 1960's, the home has been thoughtfully reimagined for family living, complemented by a modern kitchen, light-filled interiors and predominantly double glazed joinery for enhanced comfort and efficiency. The open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area forms the heart of the home, enjoying an elevated position that captures stunning sea views out to Rangitoto, creating a relaxed and inviting space to unwind or entertain. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow extends to sun-soaked outdoor areas and a swimming pool, ideal for hosting family and friends or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nThere is a pool house, a double garage with internal access, garden shed, storage areas and generous off street parking secured by an automatic gate. \r\n\r\nLocated in a prime Castor Bay setting, just moments from beaches, local amenities, and excellent school zones, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a well-rounded family home in a highly desirable coastal neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nPlease note that the current CV does not accurately reflect the property, as recent renovations have not been taken into account. Accordingly, it should not be relied upon when assessing the property's market value.",
